></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Button" data-key="button" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1719802572015" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-gpicon-button" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1719802572015" style=""><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-right-md gf-elm-right-lg gf-elm-left-xs" data-stretch-lg="0" data-stretch-sm="1" data-stretch-xs="1" data-stretch-md="0"><a class="button btn gf_button gf_gs-button-element gf_gs-button---large" href="https://www.instagram.com/kapokknot_home/?utm_source=instagram&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=ig_homepage&utm_term=20240701" target="" data-scroll-speed="2000" data-exc="" data-scroll-speed-sm="2000" data-scroll-speed-xs="2000" data-scroll-speed-md="2000"><span>Instagramを見る</span></a></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1719460251557" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1719460251557" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><b style="color: rgb(25, 25, 25);">【“MUSUBI”へのこだわり】</b></h1></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1719311739287" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1719311739287" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.7999999999999998;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 11pt 0pt;"><b style="color: rgb(195, 79, 75);"><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: 700; white-space-collapse: preserve; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px;">“MUSUBI”は</span></b></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.7999999999999998;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 11pt 0pt;"><b style="color: rgb(195, 79, 75);"><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: 700; white-space-collapse: preserve; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px;">インドネシアでひと編みずつ手編みされています。</span><br></b></p><p><b style="color: rgb(195, 79, 75);"><span id="docs-internal-guid-7e8862d2-7fff-0255-203e-23e47f4efb73" style=""><span style="font-size: 13pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">インドネシア現地へ行き、身体にフィットする編み幅について何度も改良を行いました。</span><span style="text-decoration-line: underline; font-size: 15pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><br></span></span></b></p></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1719539064763" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1719539064763" style=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1719453651525" data-id="1719453651525"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1719539064723" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1719539064723" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-sm" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">中綿の“MUSUBI” KAPOK™</h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1719539064751" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1719539064751" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><strong><br></strong></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">“MUSUBI” KAPOK™は</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">カポックという木の実の綿とコットンを独自配合しています。</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;"><br></span></p><p>カポックは、主に東南アジアに自生しており</p><p>日本でも観葉植物として扱われています。</p></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1719540156983" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1719540156983" data-layout-lg="6+6" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="6+6" data-layout-sm="6+6" data-layout-xs="12+12"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1719540156977" data-id="1719540156977"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1719539444208" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1719539444208" data-resolution="3000x3000" style=""><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/2dbda2b2-c676-4808-b89a-de169f5779fc/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/%E6%AE%B5%E8%90%BD%E3%83%86%E3%82%AD%E3%82%B9%E3%83%88%20_2_.jpeg" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="100%" data-height="auto" title="" width="1523" height="857" natural-width="1523" natural-height="857"></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1719540158571" data-id="1719540158571"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1719540096663" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1719540096663" data-resolution="3000x3000" style=""><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/a0297742-3816-4583-9b9d-d7e9f236e111/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/%E6%AE%B5%E8%90%BD%E3%83%86%E3%82%AD%E3%82%B9%E3%83%88%20_3_.jpeg" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="100%" data-height="auto" title="" width="1596" height="898" natural-width="1596" natural-height="898"></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1719539064748" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1719539064748" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; font-weight: normal;">植物由来ですが、木そのものを使用するわけでは</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; font-weight: normal;">ないので</span><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: underline;">森林伐採の必要がありません。</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; font-weight: normal;"><br></span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; font-weight: normal;">カポックの需要が増えれば増えるほど</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; font-weight: normal;">東南アジアでの雇用創出や緑化</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; font-weight: normal;">さらには<span style="text-decoration-line: underline;">森林保全のサイクル</span>が生まれることになります。</span></p></div></div><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1719540211691" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1719540211691" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/7d62a0b0-ec64-4ec1-a173-f07f0e5c3a26/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/detail_7615_15701550965263.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="100%" data-height="auto" title="" width="640" height="320" natural-width="640" natural-height="320"></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1719540270328" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1719540270328" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; text-align: inherit;">そして、このブランケットは機械で編むのではなく、</span><br></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px;">インドネシアでひと編みひと編み手作業で作られています。</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px; font-weight: normal;"><br></span></p><p>“MUSUBI”が出来上がるまでの風景⇩</p></div></div><b style="text-decoration-line: underline; color: rgb(195, 79, 75);"></b></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Carousel" data-key="carousel" data-atomgroup="module" id="m-1719456190121" class="module-wrap" data-icon